SLIDE 12 – TASK 11: TRAFFIC INVESTIGATION

Advanced Network Traffic Investigation

Activities:

• Protocol Hierarchy analysis
• Endpoint analysis
• Conversation analysis
• TCP investigation
• UDP investigation
• DNS investigation
• Traffic pattern analysis

Wireshark Path:

Statistics → Protocol Hierarchy
Statistics → Endpoints
Statistics → Conversations


SLIDE 13 – TASK 11: SECURITY INDICATORS

Possible Suspicious Activity Indicators

• Repeated connection attempts
• Unusual destination ports
• Unexpected protocols
• Abnormal DNS requests
• Large amounts of traffic
• Communication with unexpected systems

Investigation Workflow:
PCAP → Protocols → Endpoints → Conversations
→ Ports → DNS → TCP/UDP Streams → Findings


