SLIDE 16 – TASK 13: SECURITY HARDENING

Security Hardening

Objective:

Reduce the attack surface and improve
the security of the authorized lab system.

Possible Hardening Actions:

• Disable unnecessary services
• Close unused ports
• Restrict network exposure
• Apply firewall rules
• Update outdated software
• Improve security configurations


